        "jsonBody": "={{\n  {\n    model: \"llama3.2:3b\",\n    stream: false,\n    prompt: `You are a financial transaction anomaly analyst.\n\nTransaction ID: ${$json.transaction_id}\nTransaction amount: $${$json.amount}\nTransaction hour: ${$json.transaction_hour}\nIsolation Forest anomaly score: ${$json.anomaly_score}\n\nExplain in 2-3 sentences why this transaction may warrant investigation.\n\nImportant rules:\n- Use only the provided transaction details.\n- Do not assume or claim fraud.\n- Do not invent customer history or average transaction amounts.\n- The Isolation Forest anomaly score is NOT a percentage.\n- Do not convert the anomaly score into a percentage.\n- Do not interpret the score as a fraud probability.\n- Do not assume a higher score always means a more anomalous transaction.\n- Mention that the transaction amount and time may warrant review, but additional context is required.\n- Keep the explanation professional and under 80 words.`\n  }\n}}",
        "options": {}
